  "actualVerbatimFocusedWordingDecision": "Wording decision: «Добиваться результата» is a sound adaptation of the proposed «достигать результата»: both convey accomplishment, while the former avoids repeating the exact «достигать» wording in 達 and 到. That rationale is real. Their concepts remain nearby, but the explicit object «результата» and distinction between accomplishing an outcome and reaching/arriving do not create a confirmed confusing typed-title collision. 成’s new title also has no collision with 戦, 代, or 試.",
